body:
# Roksal Production Readiness — ADDENDUM k EPIC #4

Parent: #4

Po drugem, globljem pregledu trenutnega repozitorija sem našel še pomembne production zahteve, ki v prvem EPIC-u niso bile dovolj eksplicitno zapisane.

To niso generične ideje. Večina je neposredno vezana na trenutno arhitekturo kode, Prisma shemo, auth/session model, PWA/offline queue, public portal, API-je, finance in obstoječe production dokumente.

## P0 — SECURITY / DATA INTEGRITY

### 1. Demo ADMIN mora biti production-safe

Trenutni /api/auth/demo vsebuje fiksni demo račun in demo geslo ter lahko ustvari ADMIN profil.

Obvezno:
- demo route production privzeto OFF;
- demo uporabnik nikoli ni production ADMIN;
- demo baza/podatki ločeni;
- credentials niso v source/README;
- CI secret scan;
- production deploy security gate;
- test, da demo endpoint ne omogoči privileged access.

### 2. Session revocation

Stateless HMAC session token po logoutu sam po sebi ostane veljaven do expiry.

Dodati:
- session ID/JTI;
- revocation/version counter;
- revoke all sessions;
- revoke po password change;
- revoke ob deaktivaciji uporabnika;
- logout all devices;
- active-session pregled;
- test ukradenega tokena po revoke/logout/password change.

### 3. API-key lifecycle

ApiKey potrebuje:
- owner;
- purpose;
- scopes;
- project/resource scope;
- expiry;
- revoke;
- rotation;
- per-key rate limit;
- audit;
- last-used;
- one-time display secret.

### 4. Offline queue

src/lib/offline-queue.ts trenutno uporablja localStorage.

Production rešitev:
- IndexedDB;
- brez persistent bearer/API credentialov;
- client mutation ID + Idempotency-Key;
- pending/sending/succeeded/failed/conflict;
- retry/backoff;
- conflict resolution;
- ordering;
- attachment retry;
- 4xx se ne sme tiho izgubiti;
- manual retry/recovery;
- test reconnecta za vse kritične terenske tokove.

### 5. PWA/cache izolacija

Preveriti:
- privatni API podatki niso javno cacheirani;
- logout počisti občutljiv cache;
- user A -> logout -> user B ne vidi A podatkov;
- cache versioning;
- stale-data policy;
- offline retention;
- multi-user browser/device test.

### 6. CSRF / Origin

Za cookie-authenticated mutacije dodati centralni:
- Origin/Referer validation;
- CSRF zaščito, kjer je potrebna;
- ločeno obravnavo Bearer/API-key;
- cross-origin POST/PATCH/DELETE teste.

### 7. Customer portal security

clientToken je trajni javni ključ.

Dodati:
- expiry;
- revoke;
- regenerate;
- access log;
- shared rate limit;
- minimalni DTO;
- brez internih AuditLog podatkov;
- private photo access;
- cache protection;
- share/read-only policy;
- enumeration protection.

### 8. Public measurement security

/api/public/measure mora imeti:
- scoped token;
- expiry/revoke;
- shared rate limit;
- idempotency;
- duplicate protection;
- anti-abuse;
- ownership;
- omejene mutatione;
- audit.

### 9. User lifecycle

Dodati:
- invite;
- activation;
- deactivate/reactivate;
- password reset;
- email change;
- role change;
- account lock;
- session revoke;
- offboarding.

Deaktiviran uporabnik ne sme nadaljevati z že izdanim tokenom.

### 10. Permission matrix

Role-only model ni dovolj.

Formalizirati permissione:
- projects.read/write;
- customers.read/write;
- measurements.approve;
- quotes.create/approve;
- price.override;
- deal.lock;
- inventory.read/write/adjust;
- procurement.create/approve/receive;
- invoices.create/issue/cancel;
- documents.read/generate/sign;
- portal.manage;
- users.manage;
- catalog.manage;
- production.manage;
- warranty.manage.

Endpoint mora preverjati konkretno dovoljenje.

## P0 — FINANCE / NUMERICAL CORRECTNESS

### 11. Decimal namesto Float

Finance trenutno uporablja Float.

Prehod na Decimal za:
- MaterialPrice;
- MaterialOrder;
- Invoice;
- Profil prices;
- quote;
- cost;
- margin;
- payments.

Dodati centralno rounding policy in reconciliation teste.

### 12. Canonical units

Formalizirati:
- kos;
- m;
- m2;
- kg;
- l;
- komplet;
- ura;
- paket.

Dodati purchase unit, stock unit, consumption unit, supplier pack size, conversion factor, precision in rounding.

Primer: 6 m dobaviteljski profil -> 5,2 m porabe mora pravilno obravnavati naročilo, zalogo, porabo in odpad.

### 13. Procurement lifecycle

MaterialOrder potrebuje:
- RFQ;
- supplier comparison;
- PO version;
- supplier confirmation;
- partial delivery;
- backorder;
- delivery discrepancy;
- GRN/receipt;
- supplier invoice;
- PO/GRN/invoice 3-way match;
- transport;
- landed cost;
- payment terms;
- supplier performance.

### 14. Payment lifecycle

Invoice ni zaključen samo s statusom PLACAN.

Dodati:
- Payment;
- allocation;
- partial payment;
- advance;
- credit note;
- refund;
- overdue;
- reminder/dunning;
- bank/reference;
- reconciliation.

Lifecycle:
ISSUED -> SENT -> PARTIALLY_PAID -> PAID

in:
ISSUED -> OVERDUE -> REMINDER -> COLLECTION

### 15. Accounting export

Export mora imeti:
- period;
- version;
- generatedBy;
- hash;
- record count;
- total amount;
- reconciliation total.

### 16. Slovenski e-račun/fiscalization validation

Pred production preveriti:
- e-SLOG/UBL;
- XML schema;
- business rules;
- attachments;
- delivery/rejection;
- signing;
- archive;
- issuer tax data;
- customer tax data;
- DDV režime/stopnje;
- reference/payment data.

Če so podprta gotovinska plačila, mora biti posebej preverjeno FURS davčno potrjevanje.

## P0 — API / DATABASE INTEGRITY

### 17. API response minimization

Dodati:
- DTO layer;
- field allowlist;
- pagination;
- max page size;
- stable sorting;
- filters;
- query limits.

Odpraviti nepotrebne unrestricted findMany in velike nested include payloads.

### 18. Database constraints

Po PostgreSQL migraciji:
- unique constraints;
- composite indexes;
- FK/onDelete policy;
- check constraints;
- positive quantity/price rules;
- status transition protection;
- unique idempotency keys;
- invoice sequence uniqueness;
- price validity overlap protection;
- query plan review.

### 19. Atomic business transactions

V transakcijo povezati:
- quote approval;
- deal-lock;
- BOM;
- reservation;
- purchase order;
- receipt;
- inventory;
- invoice issue;
- payment;
- signature;
- state transition;
- critical audit.

### 20. System-wide idempotency

Idempotency-Key za:
- quote;
- deal-lock;
- signature;
- PDF generation;
- invoice;
- PO;
- receipt;
- stock movement;
- payment;
- offline sync.

Replay ne sme ustvariti drugega poslovnega dogodka.

### 21. Search authorization

Search ne sme biti obvoz authorizationa.

Testirati search po:
- ID;
- email;
- name;
- address;
- project;
- document;
- SKU.

### 22. Error/observability contract

Vsak request naj ima:
- correlation ID;
- structured log;
- error code;
- actor;
- resource;
- route;
- latency;
- DB duration;
- external API duration.

Uporabniku nikoli ne vračati stack trace/Prisma internals.

Monitorirati 4xx/5xx, auth, rate limit, DB errors, slow queries, failed uploads/PDF/sync/jobs.

### 23. Background jobs

PDF/VIZ/AI/image processing/export/email/sync/cleanup morajo imeti:
- job ID;
- owner;
- input;
- status;
- attempts;
- retry policy;
- error;
- idempotency;
- correlation ID.

## P1 — POSLOVNI PODATKI IN TRACEABILITY

### 24. Inventory lot/batch traceability

Kjer je relevantno:
- batch/lot;
- supplier;
- delivery;
- receipt date;
- purchase price;
- allocation;
- consumption;
- return;
- waste.

Ciljna sled:
Project -> Product -> BOM -> Material -> Supplier/Batch -> Installation.

### 25. CRM/customer model

Formalizirati:
- lead source;
- contact persons;
- billing address;
- installation address;
- tax/VAT ID;
- company/person type;
- privacy/consent;
- communication preferences;
- duplicate detection/merge;
- activities/tasks;
- attachments;
- customer audit.

### 26. Product/installation traceability

Končna sled mora biti:

Customer -> Project -> Measurement -> Configuration -> Product Version -> BOM -> Supplier Material -> Production -> Installer -> Installation -> Handover -> Warranty.

### 27. Quality control gate

Pred completion/handover:
- dimensions;
- anchoring;
- finish/RAL;
- components;
- glass;
- alignment;
- safety/compliance;
- photos;
- defects;
- corrective action;
- approvedBy/approvedAt.

Completed brez QC samo z explicit audited override.

### 28. Structured installation evidence

Shrani:
- before/after;
- location;
- timestamp;
- actor;
- project;
- GPS po policyju;
- checklist;
- measurement evidence;
- material consumption;
- defects;
- handover evidence.

### 29. Notifications

Notification lifecycle:
QUEUED -> SENT -> DELIVERED -> OPENED -> FAILED

Dodati template version, recipient, entity, correlation ID, retry, failure reason in preferences.

### 30. Scheduler conflicts

Preprečiti:
- dvojno rezervacijo ekipe;
- monterja;
- opreme;
- časovni konflikt;
- odsotnost;
- travel-time/capacity konflikt.

### 31. Equipment lifecycle

Dodati:
- acquisition;
- serial number;
- ownership;
- assignment;
- inspection;
- calibration;
- maintenance;
- repair;
- lost;
- retired.

Merilna oprema potrebuje calibration date/due/certificate.

## P1 — ENGINEERING / VARNOST

### 32. Engineering calculation validation

Kalkulator vsebuje veter, sidranje in compliance.

Za vsako formulo dokumentirati:
- vhodne predpostavke;
- standard/source;
- standard version;
- units;
- safety factors;
- load combinations;
- reference calculations;
- engineering review.

Informativni izračun mora biti jasno ločen od uradnega statičnega/projektantskega preverjanja.

### 33. External integration failure policy

OpenWeather/AI ne smeta tiho vrniti lažnega production podatka.

Weather mora ločiti:
- LIVE;
- STALE;
- UNAVAILABLE;
- DEMO.

Random/demo fallback nikoli ne sme biti prikazan kot LIVE.

Dodati timeout, retry/backoff, cache, stale policy, rate limit in source timestamp.

### 34. Versioning vseh pravil

Rezultat mora hraniti:
- Product SDK version;
- catalog version;
- price book version;
- calculator version;
- compliance rules version;
- measurement algorithm version;
- PDF template version.

### 35. Quote/document reproducibility

Official quote mora imeti immutable snapshot:
- layout;
- measurement;
- configuration;
- BOM;
- price book;
- VAT;
- discount;
- customer snapshot;
- calculator/catalog version;
- actor;
- timestamp.

## P1 — MOBILE / SYNC / STORAGE

### 36. Mobile sync conflict model

/api/sync mora imeti:
- device ID;
- client mutation ID;
- server/client timestamps;
- ordering;
- duplicate detection;
- conflict detection/resolution;
- tombstones;
- retry;
- partial sync;
- cursor/server revision.

HTTP 200 mora jasno povedati, kaj je bilo dejansko sprejeto.

### 37. Upload security

Vsi uploadi:
- MIME + magic-byte validation;
- max size;
- extension allowlist;
- image bomb protection;
- SVG/script protection;
- filename normalization;
- random object keys;
- path traversal protection;
- private-by-default;
- malware scanning policy;
- EXIF/GPS policy.

### 38. Sensitive-data policy

Definirati access/retention/export/delete za:
- IP;
- UA;
- GPS;
- signatures;
- customer data;
- supplier IBAN;
- API-key metadata;
- audit logs.

## P1 — OPERATIONS / DR / CI

### 39. Disaster recovery

Določiti:
- RPO;
- RTO;
- backup frequency;
- retention;
- off-site copy;
- DB/object recovery;
- secret recovery;
- deployment/DNS recovery;
- incident owner;
- runbook.

Izvesti dejanski recovery drill.

### 40. Deployment safety

Production deploy mora imeti:
- migration preflight;
- backup/recovery point;
- health/readiness;
- smoke test;
- rollback;
- migration compatibility;
- destructive migration gate;
- preview validation;
- production approval.

### 41. Supply-chain security

CI:
- lockfile verification;
- dependency vulnerability scan;
- license scan;
- secret scan;
- SAST;
- dependency review;
- pinned production builds.

### 42. Load/performance testing

Testirati:
- concurrent users;
- project access;
- inventory;
- PDF;
- VIZ;
- portal;
- sync bursts.

Meriti p50/p95/p99, error rate, DB connections, query time, memory, CPU, payload size in cold start.

### 43. SQLite -> PostgreSQL migration rehearsal

Pred migracijo:
- pre-count/post-count;
- checksums;
- orphan detection;
- financial reconciliation;
- VIZ/document metadata validation;
- repeatability;
- rollback.

### 44. Seed/demo/test isolation

Production ne sme vsebovati:
- demo users;
- demo credentials;
- fake customers;
- test VIZ assets;
- test seed data.

### 45. Documentation parity

README in deployment dokumentacija sta trenutno delno zastarela glede auth, SQLite/Vercel, API-jev, security in demo dostopa.

Uskladiti z dejansko kodo in dodati:
- production runbook;
- migrations;
- rollback;
- backup/restore;
- security model;
- API contract;
- architecture/data-flow;
- incident response.

## DODATNI ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA

- [ ] Demo ADMIN ni production security risk.
- [ ] Ni hardcoded credentials.
- [ ] Session revoke deluje.
- [ ] API keys imajo scope/expiry/revoke.
- [ ] Offline queue je idempotenten in ne shranjuje persistent bearer credentials.
- [ ] PWA ne omogoča cross-user leakage.
- [ ] Cookie mutacije imajo centralno CSRF/Origin zaščito.
- [ ] Portal/public measure imata lifecycle in anti-abuse zaščito.
- [ ] Finance uporablja Decimal.
- [ ] Units/conversions so canonical.
- [ ] Procurement podpira partial delivery/GRN.
- [ ] Payment lifecycle je popoln.
- [ ] Accounting export je reconciliation-safe.
- [ ] e-račun/fiscalization compliance je formalno preverjen.
- [ ] API responses so minimizirani/paginirani.
- [ ] DB constraints/indexes so production hardened.
- [ ] Critical operations so atomic.
- [ ] Critical operations so idempotentne.
- [ ] Search ne obide authorizationa.
- [ ] Vsi kritični requesti imajo correlation ID.
- [ ] Dolga opravila imajo retryable jobs.
- [ ] Demo fallback ni nikoli označen kot LIVE.
- [ ] Engineering formulas imajo dokumentiran vir in review.
- [ ] Rezultati so versionirani/reproducibilni.
- [ ] Product/material traceability je vzpostavljena.
- [ ] QC je gate pred handover/completion.
- [ ] Sync ima conflict/tombstone/revision model.
- [ ] Uploadi so hardened.
- [ ] Sensitive-data retention policy obstaja.
- [ ] RPO/RTO sta določena in recovery drill izveden.
- [ ] Production deploy ima rollback/migration gates.
- [ ] CI ima supply-chain/security scanning.
- [ ] Load test je izveden production-like.
- [ ] SQLite -> PostgreSQL migracija je rehearsed/reconciled.
- [ ] Production je brez demo/test podatkov.
- [ ] Dokumentacija ustreza dejanski kodi.

## Končna zahteva

EPIC #4 + ta addendum skupaj definirata production-ready standard.

Ne šteje kot DONE samo zato, ker endpoint obstaja, UI gumb dela ali unit test vrne 200.

DONE pomeni dokazano:

**SECURE + DURABLE + TRANSACTIONAL + AUDITABLE + REPRODUCIBLE + RECOVERABLE + TRACEABLE + COMPLIANT + OBSERVABLE + TESTED.**
